{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00356",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 6.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "Good morning. I hope the wait wasn't too long. You came on your own today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.92,
      "end_seconds": 10.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "Um, yes, I managed on my own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.26,
      "end_seconds": 14.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Go ahead, tell me what's happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.62,
      "end_seconds": 20.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.81,
      "text": "Uh, I wanted to get a bad cough looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.97,
      "end_seconds": 29.58,
      "duration_seconds": 7.61,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.1,
      "end_seconds": 38.22,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "I, I'd say mild. I get some relief from honey and warm water. And a tight chest, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.36,
      "end_seconds": 42.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Any shortness of breath, coughing up blood or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.6,
      "end_seconds": 46.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.79,
      "end_seconds": 49.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.39,
      "end_seconds": 55.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, uh, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 56.0,
      "end_seconds": 56.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.74,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.6,
      "end_seconds": 60.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.06,
      "end_seconds": 63.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Right, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.86,
      "end_seconds": 77.75,
      "duration_seconds": 12.89,
      "text": "Okay, so yes, I had my thyroid operated on, a long time ago. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.97,
      "end_seconds": 82.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.81,
      "end_seconds": 83.78,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.45,
      "end_seconds": 104.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.62,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.38,
      "end_seconds": 105.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.09,
      "end_seconds": 110.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.33,
      "end_seconds": 112.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "I've got asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.06,
      "end_seconds": 118.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Alright, yes, I can see the asthma in your file as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.46,
      "end_seconds": 123.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.12,
      "end_seconds": 124.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.02,
      "end_seconds": 142.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.4,
      "end_seconds": 149.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Asthalin inhaler, when needed. I take cough syrup, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.12,
      "end_seconds": 152.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "How long have you been on it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.42,
      "end_seconds": 154.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "About two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.21,
      "end_seconds": 157.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.68,
      "end_seconds": 167.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.38,
      "end_seconds": 189.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Okay: temp 39.1 degrees, oxygen saturation is 96 percent. And respiratory rate 16, pressure 113 over 77, heart rate 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.47,
      "end_seconds": 194.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.73,
      "end_seconds": 198.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.84,
      "end_seconds": 209.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "No crackles at the bases."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.95,
      "end_seconds": 212.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Take a breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.44,
      "end_seconds": 230.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "There are a few scattered wheezes on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.32,
      "end_seconds": 249.81,
      "duration_seconds": 13.49,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Sorry about the noise outside, the building work never stops."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 250.48,
      "end_seconds": 254.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Well, you know, I hadn't even noticed, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.44,
      "end_seconds": 266.77,
      "duration_seconds": 11.33,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with acute bronchitis. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I'd also keep pneumonia in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 267.45,
      "end_seconds": 270.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Hmm, is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.26,
      "end_seconds": 285.82,
      "duration_seconds": 13.56,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like acute bronchitis, but I'd like to confirm. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a bad cough, mild, and no shortness of breath or coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.85,
      "end_seconds": 288.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.1,
      "end_seconds": 292.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.06,
      "end_seconds": 293.91,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.88,
      "end_seconds": 315.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Let's get blood tests, for cough. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.56,
      "end_seconds": 318.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Right, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.85,
      "end_seconds": 329.89,
      "duration_seconds": 10.04,
      "text": "I'm prescribing azithromycin, 500 milligrams, once a day, for three days. That should help with chest infection. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.14,
      "end_seconds": 332.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.45,
      "end_seconds": 345.68,
      "duration_seconds": 11.23,
      "text": "Steam and warm fluids can ease the cough, and try to sleep with your head propped up. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.2,
      "end_seconds": 354.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.1,
      "text": "Okay. Keep an eye out, and if you become breathless or cough up blood, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.73,
      "end_seconds": 356.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Okay, I understand."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.15,
      "end_seconds": 359.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Let's review you in ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.09,
      "end_seconds": 362.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.56,
      "end_seconds": 367.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.26,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 369.26,
      "end_seconds": 377.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.79,
      "text": "So, I take the azithromycin, 500 milligrams, once a day and come back in ten days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.43,
      "end_seconds": 381.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.49,
      "end_seconds": 384.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "No, you've explained it well. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}